{"title": "Dread Iron Ambush", "pageid": 28030, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dread_Iron_Ambush", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dread Iron Ambush</b> is a passive feature that increases the damage of your weapon while you are hidden.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While its wielder is hidden, this weapon deals an extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Lethal_Concealment\"> Condition: Lethal Concealment </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lethal_Concealment_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethal Concealment (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lethal Concealment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lethal_Concealment_(Condition)\" title=\"Lethal Concealment (Condition)\">Lethal Concealment</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hidden\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\">Hidden</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Iron_Dagger\" title=\"Dread Iron Dagger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Iron_Dagger\" title=\"Dread Iron Dagger\">Dread Iron Dagger</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Dread Iron Ambush affects all weapon attacks while equipped, not just the weapon with the passive feature.</li>\n<li>The Lethal Concealment condition granted by Dread Iron Ambush remains even when the dagger is unequipped.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232306\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1501/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15803/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4448/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 817871/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.944      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   48.944      1 -total\n 33.68%   16.482      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 26.40%   12.921      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 24.94%   12.205      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 21.36%   10.456      1 Template:Item_icon\n 21.08%   10.317      2 Template:Icon_link\n 20.82%   10.190      1 Template:DamageText\n 20.64%   10.103     16 Template:Trim\n 20.34%    9.953      2 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28030-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714232306 and revision id 372077. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}